{
  "info": {
    "name": "CoachMax — Coach Mobile App APIs",
    "description": "Complete Postman collection for all Coach Mobile App endpoints.\n\n## Setup\n1. Set `baseUrl` variable to your server URL (default: http://localhost:4001)\n2. Login as Coach using `/api/admin/login` and copy the token\n3. Set `coachToken` variable with the token\n4. For Admin endpoints, login as Super Admin and set `adminToken`\n\n## Features Covered\n- Feature 1: Assigned Classes & Teams\n- Feature 2: Attendance with History\n- Feature 3 & 7: Player Profile / Quick Access\n- Feature 4: Temporary Players\n- Feature 5: Coach Notes\n- Feature 6: Parent Communication\n- Admin Oversight (Audit Logs, Attendance History, Conversations)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:4001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "coachToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "classId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "playerId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "parentId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "roomId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "noteId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "tempPlayerId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth",
      "description": "Login endpoints to get tokens for Coach and Admin",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Coach Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('coachToken', jsonData.token);",
                  "    console.log('Coach token saved!');",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Login successful', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.success).to.be.true;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"coach@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Coach@123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login as Coach. The token is auto-saved to `coachToken` variable."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Super Admin Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', jsonData.token);",
                  "    console.log('Admin token saved!');",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Login successful', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.success).to.be.true;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"stpl0180@outlook.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin@123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login as Super Admin. The token is auto-saved to `adminToken` variable."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "📚 Feature 1 — Assigned Classes & Teams",
      "description": "Coach can view only their assigned classes, teams, and sessions.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get My Assigned Classes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{coachToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/coach/classes?page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "coach", "classes"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "search", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "day", "value": "MONDAY", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "programId", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "categoryId", "value": "", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns only classes assigned to the authenticated coach with pagination, search, and filtering.\n\n**Filters:**\n- `search` — search by class name\n- `day` — filter by day (MONDAY, TUESDAY, etc.)\n- `programId` — filter by program\n- `categoryId` — filter by category\n\n**Response includes:** venue, date, time, age group, coach, players, sessions"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Assigned Class By ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{coachToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/coach/classes/{{classId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "coach", "classes", "{{classId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Returns detailed info for a specific assigned class including players with parent details, sessions, equipment, etc."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Class Players",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{coachToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/coach/classes/{{classId}}/players",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "coach", "classes", "{{classId}}", "players"]
            },
            "description": "Returns player list for a class with medical alert flags and parent contact info."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get My Assigned Teams",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{coachToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/coach/teams?page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "coach", "teams"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "search", "value": "", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns only teams assigned to the authenticated coach."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "✅ Feature 2 — Attendance",
      "description": "Mark and view attendance per session with full history tracking.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Mark Bulk Attendance",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{coachToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sessionDate\": \"2026-07-29\",\n  \"records\": [\n    {\n      \"player\": \"{{playerId}}\",\n      \"status\": \"PRESENT\",\n      \"comment\": \"On time\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/coach/attendance/{{classId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "coach", "attendance", "{{classId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Mark attendance for an entire session.\n\n**Status options:** `PRESENT`, `ABSENT`, `LATE`, `TRIAL`\n\nEach modification is stored in `AttendanceHistory` for audit trail.\nNotifies Super Admin on first submission."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mark Single Player Attendance",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{coachToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sessionDate\": \"2026-07-29\",\n  \"playerId\": \"{{playerId}}\",\n  \"status\": \"LATE\",\n  \"comment\": \"Arrived 10 minutes late\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/coach/attendance/{{classId}}/single",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "coach", "attendance", "{{classId}}", "single"]
            },
            "description": "Mark or update attendance for a single player.\n\n**Status options:** `PRESENT`, `ABSENT`, `LATE`, `TRIAL`\n\nCreates `AttendanceHistory` record on every change."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Attendance By Class (All Sessions)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{coachToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/coach/attendance/{{classId}}?page=1&limit=50",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "coach", "attendance", "{{classId}}"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "50" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Get all attendance records for a class across all sessions. Paginated."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Attendance By Specific Date",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{coachToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/coach/attendance/{{classId}}/date?date=2026-07-29",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "coach", "attendance", "{{classId}}", "date"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "date", "value": "2026-07-29" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Get attendance for a specific date with player details."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Admin] View Attendance History / Audit",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/attendance-history/{{classId}}?page=1&limit=50",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "attendance-history", "{{classId}}"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "50" },
                { "key": "playerId", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "sessionDate", "value": "2026-07-29", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Super Admin only.** View who modified attendance, previous values, new values, and timestamps.\n\nFilters: `playerId`, `sessionDate`"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "👤 Feature 3 & 7 — Player Profile / Quick Access",
      "description": "Aggregated player profile with medical alerts, attendance, notes, parent info, teams, programs.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Player Profile (Aggregated)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{coachToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/coach/player/{{playerId}}/profile",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "coach", "player", "{{playerId}}", "profile"]
            },
            "description": "Returns aggregated player profile including:\n\n- **Medical Alerts** (highlighted at top) — conditions, allergies, emergency contact\n- **Player Overview** — photo, name, DOB, current age, gender\n- **Parent / Guardian** — name, email, phone, address, emergency contact\n- **Programs & Classes** — enrolled programs, assigned classes\n- **Teams** — teams the player belongs to\n- **Attendance History** — last 50 records with summary stats\n- **Coach Notes** — all notes from assigned coaches\n- **Medical Profile** — detailed medical information\n\nCoach can only access players in their assigned classes."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🆕 Feature 4 — Temporary Players (Unified User/Parent Architecture)",
      "description": "Add trial/replacement players to a session. Creates Parent (with temp credentials) + User (playerStatus='PENDING_APPROVAL') records. Requires Super Admin approval to activate.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Temporary Player",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.player && jsonData.data.player._id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('tempPlayerId', jsonData.data.player._id);",
                  "    console.log('Temp player ID saved: ' + jsonData.data.player._id);",
                  "} else if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data._id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('tempPlayerId', jsonData.data._id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{coachToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Trial Player Name\",\n  \"dob\": \"2015-03-15\",\n  \"parentName\": \"Parent Full Name\",\n  \"parentEmail\": \"parent.trial@example.com\",\n  \"parentPhone\": \"+61400000000\",\n  \"emergencyContact\": \"+61400000001\",\n  \"medicalConditions\": \"None\",\n  \"allergies\": \"Asthma\",\n  \"classId\": \"{{classId}}\",\n  \"sessionDate\": \"2026-07-29\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/coach/temporary-players",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "coach", "temporary-players"]
            },
            "description": "Coach adds a temporary/trial player to a specific session.\n\n- Creates a standard `Parent` record (sends welcome email with temp password)\n- Creates a standard `User` (Player) record with `playerStatus: 'PENDING_APPROVAL'`\n- Player is assigned to the single session (`temporaryClass` and `temporarySessionDate`)\n- Super Admin is automatically notified"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get My Temporary Players",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{coachToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/coach/temporary-players?page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "coach", "temporary-players"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "playerStatus", "value": "PENDING_APPROVAL", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "classId", "value": "", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Coach views temporary/pending players.\n\nFilters: `playerStatus` (PENDING_APPROVAL, ACTIVE, REJECTED), `classId`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Admin] Get All Temporary Players",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/temporary-players?page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "temporary-players"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "playerStatus", "value": "PENDING_APPROVAL", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Super Admin only.** View all temporary/pending players from all coaches."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Admin] Approve Temporary Player",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"assignedClasses\": [\"{{classId}}\"],\n  \"category\": \"categoryObjectId\",\n  \"programs\": [\"programObjectId\"]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/temporary-players/{{tempPlayerId}}/approve",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "temporary-players", "{{tempPlayerId}}", "approve"]
            },
            "description": "**Super Admin only.** Approve a pending temporary player.\n\n- Updates `playerStatus` to `ACTIVE`\n- Optionally assigns class, category, programs, and term\n- Notifies the creating coach"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Admin] Reject Temporary Player",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Player does not meet age requirements\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/temporary-players/{{tempPlayerId}}/reject",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "temporary-players", "{{tempPlayerId}}", "reject"]
            },
            "description": "**Super Admin only.** Reject a pending temporary player.\n\n- Updates `playerStatus` to `REJECTED`\n- Notifies the creating coach with optional reason"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Admin] Cascade Delete Temporary Player",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/temporary-players/{{tempPlayerId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "temporary-players", "{{tempPlayerId}}"]
            },
            "description": "**Super Admin only.** Completely delete a player along with all associated attendance, coach notes, chat messages, and parent account (if parent has no other children)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "📝 Feature 5 — Coach Notes",
      "description": "Private player notes with typed categories. Cannot be deleted. Edits create audit records.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Coach Note",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data._id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('noteId', jsonData.data._id);",
                  "    console.log('Note ID saved: ' + jsonData.data._id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{coachToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"playerId\": \"{{playerId}}\",\n  \"classId\": \"{{classId}}\",\n  \"noteType\": \"POSITIVE_PERFORMANCE\",\n  \"description\": \"Excellent effort during drills today. Showed great improvement in passing accuracy.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/coach/notes",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "coach", "notes"]
            },
            "description": "Create a note for a player.\n\n**Note types:**\n- `ARRIVED_LATE`\n- `BEHAVIOUR_CONCERN`\n- `INJURY`\n- `MEDICAL_INCIDENT`\n- `POSITIVE_PERFORMANCE`\n- `DEVELOPMENT_AREA`\n- `PARENT_DISCUSSION`\n\nEach note includes coach name, date, and time.\nPrivate — visible only to assigned coaches and Admin."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Coach Note",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{coachToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"noteType\": \"DEVELOPMENT_AREA\",\n  \"description\": \"Updated: Needs to work on left foot passing. Good attitude overall.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/coach/notes/{{noteId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "coach", "notes", "{{noteId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Edit an existing note.\n\n**Creates an audit record** with old vs new values.\nOnly the original coach or Super Admin can edit.\nNote is flagged as `isEdited: true`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get My Notes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{coachToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/coach/notes?page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "coach", "notes"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "noteType", "value": "INJURY", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "playerId", "value": "", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Get all notes created by the authenticated coach.\nSuper Admin sees all notes.\n\nFilters: `noteType`, `playerId`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Notes By Player",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{coachToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/coach/notes/player/{{playerId}}?page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "coach", "notes", "player", "{{playerId}}"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "noteType", "value": "", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Get all notes for a specific player.\nCoach can only view notes for players in their assigned classes."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Note Audit History",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{coachToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/coach/notes/{{noteId}}/audit",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "coach", "notes", "{{noteId}}", "audit"]
            },
            "description": "Get the full edit history (audit trail) for a specific note."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "💬 Feature 6 — Parent Communication",
      "description": "In-app coach-parent messaging. Phone numbers hidden. Messages cannot be deleted.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Start Direct Chat with Parent",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data._id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('roomId', jsonData.data._id);",
                  "    console.log('Room ID saved: ' + jsonData.data._id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{coachToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"parentId\": \"{{parentId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/coach/chat/direct",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "coach", "chat", "direct"]
            },
            "description": "Start or retrieve a direct chat room with a parent.\n\nCoach can only contact parents whose children are in their assigned classes."
          }
        },
        {
